# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Never commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env holds generated database and admin passwords. If you have already
# committed it: rotate every secret in it, then purge it from history with
# git-filter-repo - deleting it in a new commit leaves it readable in the old.
.env
stack/.env
*.env
!.env.example
!stack/.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Licensed XenForo source. Must never be committed to a public repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The working copy the container serves - 13,000+ disposable files, and it is
# commercial licensed software.
webroot/
stack/webroot/
xf-webroot/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
snapshots/
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
